Best to make an example of them.

512
00:29:28,480 --> 00:29:31,217
We were engaged in
combat on a daily basis.

513
00:29:31,300 --> 00:29:33,712
Criminals hunted by the world government.

514
00:29:34,460 --> 00:29:39,240
Meanwhile, Queen Otohime waged her own
stubborn form of battle against the world.

515
00:29:39,680 --> 00:29:40,510
Sign here!

516
00:29:40,740 --> 00:29:42,020
No, we won't!

517
00:29:42,140 --> 00:29:43,977
We don't want to live with humans!

518
00:29:44,060 --> 00:29:44,890
Please sign!

519
00:29:45,480 --> 00:29:46,310
Hey!

520
00:29:46,580 --> 00:29:49,815
The government put out a
bounty on Boss Tai and Jinbei!

521
00:29:51,140 --> 00:29:51,970
Seriously?

522
00:29:52,360 --> 00:29:54,740
Wow, 230 million bearings!

523
00:29:55,060 --> 00:29:57,680
Jinbei's got 76 million on his head!

524
00:29:58,460 --> 00:29:59,480
Wanted posters!

525
00:29:59,920 --> 00:30:02,449
Look, they raised the
reward on them again!

526
00:30:02,640 --> 00:30:04,997
Even the world government
is scared of them!

527
00:30:05,080 --> 00:30:05,910
Yeah, yeah!

528
00:30:06,060 --> 00:30:08,119
They're gonna sink the entire navy!

529
00:30:09,660 --> 00:30:11,380
I need you to sign it!

530
00:30:11,600 --> 00:30:12,857
Let me go, your majesty!

531
00:30:12,940 --> 00:30:17,957
See the next three years unfolded
in a similar manner and then one day

532
00:30:18,040 --> 00:30:23,037
we came across a young girl on an
island Mister we could use your help

533
00:30:23,120 --> 00:30:28,337
with something this girl here she
escaped from Marie Joie with the

534
00:30:28,420 --> 00:30:33,260
rest of us back when you liberated
us from slavery three years ago here

535
00:30:34,020 --> 00:30:34,850
Look

536
00:30:38,120 --> 00:30:43,057
She hasn't seen her parents in many years
And her home's far away We would like to

537
00:30:43,140 --> 00:30:47,964
help I'm sure they miss her But it's highly
doubtful we can safely cross the ocean

538
00:30:49,500 --> 00:30:53,177
I'm Koala and I'm 11 years
old Thanks for saving

539
00:30:53,260 --> 00:30:56,319
me I'll do my best not to
cause you any more trouble

540
00:30:57,180 --> 00:30:59,777
I know she's a kid But
she's still a disgusting

541
00:30:59,860 --> 00:31:02,917
human Why the hell would you
let her on board with us?

542
00:31:03,000 --> 00:31:04,240
Just drop it, Orlang.

543
00:31:04,880 --> 00:31:06,620
I'll drop this ugly brat!

544
00:31:07,060 --> 00:31:08,397
Quit smiling, dammit!

545
00:31:08,480 --> 00:31:09,340
Orlang, no!

546
00:31:12,180 --> 00:31:13,240
Calm down!

547
00:31:13,620 --> 00:31:14,500
Let go, Hachi!

548
00:31:14,720 --> 00:31:16,740
I'm not done yet! He's right.

549
00:31:17,140 --> 00:31:19,880
It is creepy how she won't stop smiling.

550
00:31:25,320 --> 00:31:26,840
Huh? You?

551
00:31:31,380 --> 00:31:32,580
What are you...

552
00:31:33,380 --> 00:31:34,210
I'm sorry.

553
00:31:34,293 --> 00:31:35,280
I'm a hard worker.

554
00:31:35,720 --> 00:31:38,137
I'll clean, and I don't
need to take a break.

555
00:31:38,220 --> 00:31:40,597
So please don't hit me. I'm sorry.

556
00:31:40,680 --> 00:31:41,740
I'm sorry.

557
00:31:42,000 --> 00:31:43,460
I'll give it my best.

558
00:31:44,220 --> 00:31:45,050
Stop.

559
00:31:45,360 --> 00:31:46,420
I'm sorry.

560
00:31:46,800 --> 00:31:47,760
I'm sorry.

561
00:31:48,220 --> 00:31:49,500
I'll clean it.

562
00:31:49,880 --> 00:31:51,200
You're bleeding.

563
00:31:51,700 --> 00:31:52,540
I'm sorry.

564
00:31:52,860 --> 00:31:55,140
I promise that I'll never cry.

565
00:31:55,580 --> 00:31:57,220
Just please don't kill me.

566
00:32:00,860 --> 00:32:01,900
It's all right.

567
00:32:02,220 --> 00:32:04,120
Are you scared of us?

568
00:32:04,320 --> 00:32:08,600
Yes, but I really miss my mother,
so I made myself get on board.

569
00:32:09,760 --> 00:32:11,300
I won't stop cleaning.

570
00:32:11,660 --> 00:32:14,800
I know if I do, you'll think
I'm useless and kill me.

571
00:32:15,000 --> 00:32:18,220
But I'm a hard worker,
so please let me live.

572
00:32:19,360 --> 00:32:20,772
Well, what'd you expect?

573
00:32:20,980 --> 00:32:22,800
The kid was raised a slave.

574
00:32:23,660 --> 00:32:25,307
Think about what she's seen.

575
00:32:25,640 --> 00:32:27,377
I'm sure plenty of her friends got killed.

576
00:32:27,460 --> 00:32:31,107
And probably just for crying or
getting caught taking a break.

577
00:32:31,260 --> 00:32:34,697
She's spent her whole life being
afraid that she might be next.

578
00:32:34,780 --> 00:32:37,251
Can you blame her for not trusting anyone?

579
00:32:39,780 --> 00:32:40,610
Boss?

580
00:32:42,720 --> 00:32:43,980
Pick up this brat.

581
00:32:44,220 --> 00:32:45,985
I want her brought to my room.

582
00:32:48,120 --> 00:32:49,591
What's he doing in there?

583
00:32:49,880 --> 00:32:51,457
Lecturing her won't do any good.

584
00:32:51,540 --> 00:32:53,300
The poor kid's too far gone.

585
00:33:02,160 --> 00:33:04,042
Boss, what are you doing to her?

586
00:33:13,780 --> 00:33:14,610
Bandage her.

587
00:33:15,060 --> 00:33:16,140
It may have hurt,

588
00:33:16,300 --> 00:33:20,594
but she'd never get past the pain of
being a slave with that mark on her.

589
00:33:20,840 --> 00:33:22,580
Hey, kid, you still alive?

590
00:33:26,940 --> 00:33:28,580
Oh, good, you're awake.

591
00:33:29,220 --> 00:33:30,657
Oh, I guess I passed out.

592
00:33:30,740 --> 00:33:34,200
I'm sorry, but I didn't cry, did I?

593
00:33:34,340 --> 00:33:35,517
So you don't need to kill me.

594
00:33:35,600 --> 00:33:37,477
I promise you, I'll never cry.

595
00:33:37,560 --> 00:33:39,360
So please, let me live.

596
00:33:43,140 --> 00:33:44,880
It's okay for you to cry.

597
00:33:47,820 --> 00:33:50,657
We are nothing like those
evil celestial dragons

598
00:33:50,740 --> 00:33:55,280
so don't you dare act
like we are now watch.

599
00:34:35,700 --> 00:34:36,900
No killing.

600
00:34:37,300 --> 00:34:38,780
Not now, not ever.

601
00:34:39,460 --> 00:34:41,860
Is everyone with me? Yeah!

602
00:34:43,520 --> 00:34:45,417
No matter how far the journey,

603
00:34:45,500 --> 00:34:51,720
we're taking this girl back home.

604
00:35:12,220 --> 00:35:13,050
Thank you.
